Z||000001||jhogans||10-19-1999||07:37 PM||||I saw this one also.  This is one bad ass car.  It even has a V8!!!!!!  I believe he is selling the car for $19000.<P>I give this car a 10.  The paint, rims, chop top, and V8 are just down right awesome.  This is one tight ride.<P>I love seeing nice Fieros.  I can't wait till I get one.  I plan to head to Columbus to check out one this weekend.  I hope all goes well.||||reg||14
