Z||000003||87GT||10-19-1999||08:54 PM||||That car looks pretty awesome, but the top needs to be put back where it was. lol!  My head hurts with the thought of getting in and out of it. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||hefty||10-19-1999||09:38 PM||||I couldn't chop the top on my current (and 1st ) Fiero, but I like the look, great colour. ||||reg||1
